              "testData": "<!-- Default values for NMTOKENS attributes must match Nmtokens. -->\n<!DOCTYPE foo [\n<!ELEMENT foo EMPTY>\n<!ATTLIST foo a NMTOKENS \"34+\">\n]>\n<foo a=\"34\"/>\n",
              "description": "Default values for NMTOKENS attributes must match Nmtokens."
